    "text": "<p>Consider the diagram in a displaced position.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image14-b9f1c31e-daa9-42ff-a2f7-b6aa909c45dc.jpg\" /></p><p>The weight and upthrust <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></math>, both pass through the centre of gravity&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>g</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>g</mi></math></p><p>The restoring torque about the pivot is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>d</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow